OL,3,CLondon Stadium landlord advises David
OL,4,CSullivan not to attend Hammers home
OL,5,Cgames.
OL,7,FDavid Sullivan has been advised to
OL,8,Fstay away from West Ham's home matches
OL,9,Fby the London Stadium's landlord
OL,10,Ffollowing allegations of sexual
OL,11,Fmisconduct.
OL,13,FThe West Ham co-owner was accused of
OL,14,Fsexually exploitative and predatory
OL,15,Fbehaviour by seven women during a
OL,16,Fjoint investigation by BBC Panorama
OL,17,Fand The Times into the 77-year-old
OL,18,Fbusinessman.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/6
