OL,3,CLondon Stadium landlord advises David
OL,4,CSullivan not to attend Hammers home
OL,5,Cgames.
OL,7,FSullivan ` West Ham's largest
OL,8,Fshareholder ` stood down as joint
OL,9,Fchairman of the club shortly before
OL,10,Fthe investigation was broadcast in
OL,11,FJune, saying he wanted to focus on
OL,12,Ffighting what he called "factually
OL,13,Fincorrect and entirely false, decades-
OL,14,Fold allegations concerning my personal
OL,15,Flife".
OL,26,@tD@YOUwD@EO]
