OL,3,CLondon Stadium landlord advises David
OL,4,CSullivan not to attend Hammers home
OL,5,Cgames.
OL,7,FWest Ham, who were relegated from the
OL,8,FPremier League in May, start their
OL,9,Fseason on Saturday with a Carabao Cup
OL,10,Fhome tie against Portsmouth, and venue
OL,11,Foperators London Stadium say Sullivan
OL,12,Fshould stay away "given the potential
OL,13,Ffor demonstrations and anti-social
OL,14,Fbehaviour by some spectators".
OL,26,@tD@ROUvD@]O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/6
