PN,37504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785925100
OL,3,CLondon Stadium landlord advises David
OL,4,CSullivan not to attend Hammers home
OL,5,Cgames.
OL,7,FA London Stadium statement read:
OL,8,F"Following media reports at the end of
OL,9,Fthe season regarding a safeguarding
OL,10,Fmatter being managed by the club,
OL,11,FLondon Stadium sought further
OL,12,Finformation to ensure it could fulfil
OL,13,Fits own safeguarding responsibilities.
OL,15,F"Based on the information provided by
OL,16,Fthe club, we understand the matter was
OL,17,Finvestigated and that the club does
OL,18,Fnot consider there to be an ongoing
OL,19,Fsafeguarding risk associated with Mr
OL,20,FSullivan attending the stadium.
OL,26,@pD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
