PN,37505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1785925100
OL,3,CLondon Stadium landlord advises David
OL,4,CSullivan not to attend Hammers home
OL,5,Cgames.
OL,7,F"However, given the potential for
OL,8,Fdemonstrations and anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour by some spectators, we have
OL,10,Frecommended to the club that he does
OL,11,Fnot attend.
OL,13,F"We have also requested advance notice
OL,14,Fof any planned attendance so that
OL,15,Fappropriate safety and operational
OL,16,Fmeasures can be put in place."
OL,18,FLondon Stadium said it would not
OL,19,Fcomment if they receive notice from
OL,20,FWest Ham on Sullivan attending matches
OL,21,Fat the 62,500-capacity arena.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUxD@^O]
